WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:34.530
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:38.170
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.170 --> 00:42.160
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.750 --> 01:00.020
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

01:00.020 --> 01:03.660
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.660 --> 01:07.300
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
<b>Let it go, shinjiyou</b>

01:36.990 --> 01:40.830
<b>As the Sanzo Party continues
their journey,</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:43.630
<b>a suspicious fortune-teller suddenly
appears before them.</b>

01:45.400 --> 01:46.870
<b>Chin Yisou...</b>

01:53.070 --> 01:56.810
<b>Chin Yisou disappears leaving
mysterious words behind him.</b>

01:56.810 --> 01:58.680
<b>And then as if exchanging places,</b>

01:58.680 --> 02:04.020
<b>a giant crab-like Shikigami comes
to stand in the Sanzo Party's way.</b>

02:08.390 --> 02:10.420
<b>Is it another one of
Kougaiji's assassins?!</b>

02:13.060 --> 02:15.500
<b>But what the group sees as
they prepare to fight it</b>

02:15.500 --> 02:20.700
<b>is Kougaiji's younger sister, Lirin,
defeating the giant shikigami.</b>

02:26.540 --> 02:30.550
<b>Then Kougaiji and his people
appear to take back his sister,</b>

02:30.550 --> 02:34.000
<b>and the direct confrontation
has finally begun.</b>

03:01.540 --> 03:05.980
<b>That bastard's definitely gotten
stronger since last time.</b>

03:05.980 --> 03:07.880
<b>Hey!</b>

03:07.880 --> 03:11.220
<b>You said you'd pay me back
twice over, right?!</b>

03:11.920 --> 03:13.390
<b>Damn it!</b>

03:18.490 --> 03:20.430
<b>It's no fun if you don't get serious!</b>

03:34.140 --> 03:37.200
<b>What the hell are you doing?!</b>

03:45.550 --> 03:47.320
<b>What am I doing? Me?</b>

03:48.290 --> 03:49.760
<b>Quit playing around!</b>

03:57.370 --> 03:58.890
<b>Playing around?</b>

04:00.700 --> 04:02.690
<b>What do you have to fight for?</b>

04:06.140 --> 04:09.700
<b>You're just on an aimless journey.
What could you have?</b>

04:23.430 --> 04:24.890
<b>Mother...</b>

04:28.860 --> 04:30.330
<b>I...</b>

04:36.270 --> 04:37.740
<b>Mother, for you...</b>

04:43.710 --> 04:46.650
<b>I'll fight with everything
I have for you.</b>

04:48.420 --> 04:49.880
<b>I...</b>

04:52.220 --> 04:53.690
<b>Damn it!</b>

05:00.360 --> 05:08.770
<b>No matter who I'm fighting,
I can't afford to lose!</b>

05:15.540 --> 05:17.010
<b>This bastard is...</b>

05:19.680 --> 05:21.270
<b>He's smiling!</b>

05:25.720 --> 05:26.190
<b>Goku!</b>

05:26.190 --> 05:27.490
<b>Lord Kougaiji!
Goku!</b>

05:27.490 --> 05:27.760
<b>Lord Kougaiji!
Goku!</b>

05:27.760 --> 05:28.950
<b>Goku!</b>

05:50.850 --> 05:52.340
<b>What?!</b>

05:59.020 --> 06:01.650
<b>What the hell are you doing?!</b>

06:03.360 --> 06:05.120
<b>That didn't hurt at all!</b>

06:11.030 --> 06:12.400
<b>Is that all?</b>

06:12.400 --> 06:12.530
<b>No, I've got more. Want it?
Is that all?</b>

06:12.530 --> 06:15.470
<b>No, I've got more. Want it?</b>

06:15.470 --> 06:16.940
<b>Yay!</b>

06:29.750 --> 06:32.380
<b>What the hell are you fighting for?!</b>

06:34.720 --> 06:36.990
<b>How is he...</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:44.060
<b>You've got nothing to protect!</b>

06:45.300 --> 06:48.270
<b>How?! How is he able to
become so strong?!</b>

06:49.140 --> 06:53.640
<b>I have something I have to protect!</b>

06:53.640 --> 06:56.870
<b>I don't get what you're saying at all!</b>

06:58.380 --> 07:00.280
<b>What do I fight for?!</b>

07:03.250 --> 07:04.720
<b>That's...</b>

07:06.020 --> 07:08.510
<b>For myself, what else?!</b>

07:09.260 --> 07:12.890
<b>For yourself? Hey, is that all?!</b>

07:16.260 --> 07:18.560
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

07:20.200 --> 07:21.690
<b>That's all there is to it.</b>

07:25.210 --> 07:26.370
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

07:26.370 --> 07:26.710
<b>Lord Kougaiji!
Kougaiji!</b>

07:26.710 --> 07:27.830
<b>Lord Kougaiji!</b>

07:29.340 --> 07:32.470
<b>What I felt when I fought him
that first time...</b>

07:34.680 --> 07:38.050
<b>I felt I didn't have those things.</b>

07:38.050 --> 07:41.320
<b>Freedom... Confidence... An identity...</b>

07:42.090 --> 07:45.690
<b>Just those things make
these guys strong.</b>

07:46.590 --> 07:48.060
<b>That is...</b>

07:50.770 --> 07:52.390
<b>...absolute power.</b>

07:57.570 --> 07:59.140
<b>Lord Kougaiji!</b>

07:59.140 --> 08:01.780
<b>Kougaiji, let me take care of him!</b>

08:01.780 --> 08:03.240
<b>No!</b>

08:04.450 --> 08:06.470
<b>I'm his opponent!</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:12.250
<b>I always give as good as I've gotten!</b>

08:12.250 --> 08:17.350
<b>Yeah! I don't like it if I don't get
as good as I've given either!</b>

08:18.160 --> 08:21.030
<b>You better not come crying for mercy!</b>

08:21.030 --> 08:23.090
<b>That's my line!</b>

08:24.600 --> 08:26.070
<b>My, my.</b>

08:26.700 --> 08:28.860
<b>They seem to be having such fun.</b>

08:29.800 --> 08:32.470
<b>But if they're going to have a party,</b>

08:32.470 --> 08:36.100
<b>it ought to be far more
spectacular than this.</b>

08:36.640 --> 08:43.920
<b>I shall lend a hand, especially
to you, Cho Hakkai.</b>

08:43.920 --> 08:46.350
<b>No, Cho Gonou, to you!</b>

08:50.660 --> 08:52.130
<b>Cho Gonou!</b>

08:56.430 --> 08:59.560
<b>To you, with love.</b>

09:10.950 --> 09:12.480
<b>Goku...</b>

09:12.480 --> 09:13.950
<b>Behind you!</b>

09:14.420 --> 09:15.880
<b>What?!</b>

09:23.460 --> 09:27.190
<b>Now, the fun is just starting.</b>

09:52.590 --> 09:54.260
<b>Goku...</b>

09:54.260 --> 09:56.060
<b>Behind you!</b>

09:56.060 --> 09:57.520
<b>What?!</b>

10:06.600 --> 10:08.070
<b>What?!</b>

10:11.210 --> 10:11.940
<b>Goku!</b>

10:11.940 --> 10:12.710
<b>Lord Kougaiji!
Goku!</b>

10:12.710 --> 10:13.400
<b>Lord Kougaiji!</b>

10:21.580 --> 10:23.050
<b>Damn!</b>

10:29.720 --> 10:31.190
<b>Gojyo!</b>

10:37.400 --> 10:38.570
<b>Are you all right?</b>

10:38.570 --> 10:38.900
<b>Yes...
Are you all right?</b>

10:38.900 --> 10:40.030
<b>Yes...</b>

10:40.500 --> 10:42.040
<b>What'swith this thing?!</b>

10:42.040 --> 10:44.440
<b>Hurry up and run! I can't hold him!</b>

10:45.470 --> 10:47.140
<b>Run?! What're you...</b>

10:47.140 --> 10:51.480
<b>There's no way we can fight
this monster head on!</b>

10:58.690 --> 11:00.350
<b>Thanks, I owe you one.</b>

11:01.520 --> 11:02.990
<b>Save it.</b>

11:04.260 --> 11:06.920
<b>It's no fun when there's
outside interference.</b>

11:07.760 --> 11:09.230
<b>It's called a truce.</b>

11:12.470 --> 11:17.510
<b>That's so weird! I defeated him
just a minute ago!</b>

11:17.510 --> 11:18.810
<b>Hey...</b>

11:18.810 --> 11:19.010
<b>What?
Hey...</b>

11:19.010 --> 11:20.170
<b>What?</b>

11:20.170 --> 11:21.640
<b>What are you doing?</b>

11:22.540 --> 11:24.180
<b>What do you mean?</b>

11:24.180 --> 11:25.710
<b>Get off.</b>

11:25.710 --> 11:27.180
<b>Cheapskate!</b>

11:28.280 --> 11:30.180
<b>You are so dead.</b>

11:30.180 --> 11:33.490
<b>A shikigami, and such
an enormous one...</b>

11:33.490 --> 11:37.620
<b>So it wasn't you people who
sent it to get us after all.</b>

11:41.230 --> 11:44.730
<b>Then is it Chin Yisou after all?</b>

11:44.730 --> 11:46.220
<b>That fortune-teller?</b>

11:47.030 --> 11:50.770
<b>But that icy, bloodthirsty aura...</b>

11:53.740 --> 11:54.540
<b>Gojyo!</b>

11:54.540 --> 11:55.240
<b>Ow! It had no effect on him at all!
Gojyo!</b>

11:55.240 --> 11:56.940
<b>Ow! It had no effect on him at all!</b>

11:58.110 --> 12:01.780
<b>Damn, cutting off a leg or two
is just a waste of our time!</b>

12:03.480 --> 12:06.150
<b>We'll have to blow the whole thing
to pieces to settle this!</b>

12:06.790 --> 12:08.690
<b>I'll do it.</b>

12:08.690 --> 12:10.290
<b>You probably can't do it alone.</b>

12:10.290 --> 12:11.760
<b>Don't underestimate me.</b>

12:14.230 --> 12:15.700
<b>Lord Kougaiji!</b>

12:17.630 --> 12:19.230
<b>Yaone!</b>

12:19.230 --> 12:20.700
<b>Miss Yaone!</b>

12:22.340 --> 12:23.800
<b>Miss Yaone!</b>

12:26.940 --> 12:28.440
<b>Yaone...</b>

12:28.440 --> 12:30.810
<b>Sorry, but take care of her for me.</b>

12:42.020 --> 12:43.090
<b>Goku...</b>

12:43.090 --> 12:43.520
<b>What is it?
Goku...</b>

12:44.460 --> 12:46.890
<b>Can you keep the shikigami
from moving?</b>

12:48.900 --> 12:51.030
<b>If you can buy me some time,</b>

12:51.030 --> 12:53.630
<b>I can summon a beast from
the demon plane.</b>

12:54.670 --> 12:58.040
<b>That's the only way we'll
defeat this monster!</b>

12:58.040 --> 12:59.870
<b>Okay! Got it!</b>

12:59.870 --> 13:01.340
<b>Monkey!</b>

13:05.980 --> 13:08.780
<b>I'll fight for my own sake!</b>

13:08.780 --> 13:10.340
<b>I won't allow anyone
to get in my way!</b>

13:12.320 --> 13:14.620
<b>That's the way to go! It wouldn't be
fun otherwise!</b>

13:15.320 --> 13:17.860
<b>Listen to me! I only need a moment!</b>

13:17.860 --> 13:19.930
<b>Keep that thing in one place!</b>

13:19.930 --> 13:21.760
<b>Then we can settle this in one shot!</b>

13:22.700 --> 13:25.600
<b>I'll believe in you, Kougaiji.</b>

13:28.770 --> 13:31.800
<b>Monkey, don't get caught in the blast.</b>

13:32.440 --> 13:35.670
<b>Sure thing! And you better not miss!</b>

13:36.740 --> 13:38.270
<b>Never mind! Just go!</b>

13:38.980 --> 13:40.450
<b>Nyoi-bou!</b>

13:49.220 --> 13:53.590
<b>Sheesh, don't those guys get
that they're enemies?</b>

13:53.590 --> 13:55.860
<b>And what's that sitting
on top of you?</b>

13:56.930 --> 14:00.970
<b>Hey, I wanna join in and
have some fun too!</b>

14:00.970 --> 14:04.570
<b>I'm the one who defeated
him last time!</b>

14:04.570 --> 14:07.640
<b>This one seems a bit different
than the last one.</b>

14:07.640 --> 14:08.610
<b>I wanna!</b>

14:08.610 --> 14:09.140
<b>Then get off!
I wanna!</b>

14:09.140 --> 14:10.080
<b>Then get off!</b>

14:12.010 --> 14:13.780
<b>Just leave it up to them.</b>

14:18.050 --> 14:19.820
<b>Leave it to your brother.</b>

14:28.460 --> 14:32.870
<b>Well, well, did you enjoy the show?</b>

14:40.540 --> 14:43.480
<b>Oh, dear, your friend is certainly...</b>

14:46.350 --> 14:47.870
<b>...very energetic.</b>

14:50.450 --> 14:51.920
<b>Cho Gonou!</b>

15:10.470 --> 15:13.410
<b>Please enjoy it while you can.</b>

15:13.410 --> 15:17.780
<b>After all, your fortunes say
you're fated to die.</b>

15:20.450 --> 15:22.650
<b>Say, Cho Gonou,</b>

15:22.650 --> 15:25.480
<b>the more precious things you have,</b>

15:26.350 --> 15:30.590
<b>the more you have worth losing,
don't you think?</b>

15:30.590 --> 15:32.180
<b>Here goes, Kougaiji!</b>

15:33.860 --> 15:35.700
Dodge it, Goku!

15:35.700 --> 15:37.560
<b>I'll apologize to you for one thing!</b>

15:39.000 --> 15:42.090
<b>I had reservations about
the path I had chosen!</b>

15:42.840 --> 15:45.040
<b>But not anymore!</b>

15:45.040 --> 15:48.300
<b>I have something precious, not
measured in terms of good or evil!</b>

15:50.610 --> 15:53.240
<b>So I'll fight for my own sake!</b>

15:54.480 --> 15:56.180
<b>Is that so?!</b>

15:56.180 --> 15:58.080
<b>Longer, Nyoi-bou!</b>

16:06.190 --> 16:07.660
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

16:08.200 --> 16:11.860
<b>Come forth, Engokuki!</b>

16:51.610 --> 16:56.270
<b>I felt a large disturbance of
demonic power in the East.</b>

16:56.840 --> 17:01.150
<b>Yes, it seems Lord Kougaiji
summoned a fiend.</b>

17:01.150 --> 17:02.620
<b>Oh, really.</b>

17:03.380 --> 17:05.720
<b>You seem uninterested.</b>

17:05.720 --> 17:08.590
<b>You thought I'd be interested, Ni?</b>

17:09.820 --> 17:11.730
<b>I don't know.</b>

17:11.730 --> 17:14.250
<b>Well, I don't really care either way.</b>

17:16.130 --> 17:18.260
<b>Is Lirin safe?</b>

17:18.930 --> 17:25.340
<b>So, even Lady Gyokumen Koushu
worries about her own child?</b>

17:25.340 --> 17:31.800
<b>Of course, because I absolutely
need her to revive Gyumaoh.</b>

17:32.910 --> 17:35.780
<b>Isn't that right, Ni?</b>

17:39.320 --> 17:42.360
<b>My, my, that was something
that YOU found out.</b>

17:42.360 --> 17:48.260
<b>No, all I did was merely report
the results of my research.</b>

17:48.260 --> 17:50.400
<b>I don't care what it is.</b>

17:50.400 --> 17:54.070
<b>If I can resurrect Gyumaoh,
I'll be happy.</b>

17:54.070 --> 17:58.600
<b>Everything I want, I'll get
with my own two hands.</b>

17:59.170 --> 18:03.010
<b>My darling, I'll have all that is you.</b>

18:17.960 --> 18:19.730
<b>Did we get him?</b>

18:19.730 --> 18:21.190
<b>Looks like it.</b>

18:23.900 --> 18:25.800
<b>Kougaiji...</b>

18:25.800 --> 18:29.400
<b>We'll excuse ourselves for today,</b>

18:29.400 --> 18:31.370
<b>since that big thing got in our way.</b>

18:35.040 --> 18:39.000
<b>I questioned the path I had
chosen to follow.</b>

18:40.010 --> 18:43.180
<b>I feel it was rude of me to have
challenged you to a fight</b>

18:43.180 --> 18:45.710
<b>when I was still unsure of myself.</b>

18:46.620 --> 18:48.860
<b>But it'll be different next time.</b>

18:48.860 --> 18:51.690
<b>I'll defeat you with everyhing I have!</b>

18:53.560 --> 18:55.200
<b>For my own sake...</b>

18:55.200 --> 18:58.200
<b>You still haven't paid me back
enough to be twice over.</b>

18:58.200 --> 19:00.700
<b>Put it on my tab. I'll pay you
right back.</b>

19:00.700 --> 19:04.770
<b>Sanzo, I'll come again!
Let's play together then!</b>

19:04.770 --> 19:07.040
<b>I ain't playing with you, damn brat!</b>

19:07.040 --> 19:09.740
<b>At least bring a souvenir next time.</b>

19:09.740 --> 19:11.840
<b>And the least you could do
is serve some tea.</b>

19:12.480 --> 19:14.950
<b>Please take care of your injury.</b>

19:14.950 --> 19:16.640
<b>I wish you all well.</b>

19:21.490 --> 19:23.850
<b>She wished us well.</b>

19:26.860 --> 19:28.850
<b>Man, that's a hard enemy
to deal with.</b>

19:30.130 --> 19:35.120
<b>They're also probably nothing more
than someone else's pawns.</b>

19:36.270 --> 19:38.510
<b>The idiot who's plotting
to resurrect Gyumaoh</b>

19:38.510 --> 19:44.030
<b>and called down the chaos onto
this world is behind Kougaiji.</b>

19:45.080 --> 19:47.270
<b>The true enemy we must defeat.</b>

19:48.350 --> 19:51.290
<b>At any rate, let's get out of this town.</b>

19:51.290 --> 19:52.750
<b>Let's do that.</b>

19:56.190 --> 19:57.660
<b>Could this be...</b>

19:58.430 --> 20:00.150
<b>The true form of that shikigami?</b>

20:15.610 --> 20:18.810
<b>You have the eyes of a sinner!</b>

20:21.620 --> 20:23.380
<b>Hakkai, what's wrong?!</b>

20:24.690 --> 20:26.780
<b>It's nothing.</b>

20:33.330 --> 20:36.820
<b>I've seen those eyes somewhere.</b>

20:38.500 --> 20:39.970
<b>Who in the world is he?</b>

20:43.540 --> 20:49.940
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:49.940 --> 20:55.350
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:55.350 --> 21:00.820
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

21:00.820 --> 21:04.220
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:04.220 --> 21:10.030
<b>Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:10.030 --> 21:15.470
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:15.470 --> 21:20.770
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo
onaji koto darou</b>

21:20.770 --> 21:24.710
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:31.720 --> 21:35.390
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.390 --> 21:37.320
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.320 --> 21:41.460
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.460 --> 21:45.600
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:45.600 --> 21:48.270
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.270 --> 21:53.310
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de</b>

21:53.310 --> 21:58.710
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:58.710 --> 22:04.150
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo
onaji koto darou</b>

22:04.150 --> 22:08.180
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:18.200 --> 22:19.670
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:20.530 --> 22:23.340
<b>"He wears a scripture draped about
his shoulders as a vestment"</b>

22:23.340 --> 22:24.910
<b>"and has the crimson chakra
upon his brow."</b>

22:24.910 --> 22:29.140
<b>"With three followers at his side,
he disperses the demonic."</b>

22:29.140 --> 22:32.210
<b>Hey, this is describing
Sanzo and us, right?</b>

22:32.210 --> 22:36.480
<b>But I don't know anything about what
happened four hundred years ago.</b>

22:37.820 --> 22:39.620
<b>Next time on Gensou Maden
Saiyuki, "False Saviors"</b>

22:39.620 --> 22:42.320
<b>Next Time
False Saviors
Next time on Gensou Maden
Saiyuki, "False Saviors"</b>

22:42.320 --> 22:42.660
<b>Next Time
False Saviors
You'd do well to watch.</b>

22:42.660 --> 22:43.750
<b>You'd do well to watch.</b>
